{"4504000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UltraHero", "steam_appid": 4504000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight The Dark Armies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight increasingly difficult and larger armies of enemies. Gain experience and power, upgrade your skills, and prepare to challenge the Gods. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/01bf3cab5544da5011a7c400fdb5a141.poster.avif?t=1773744850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/01bf3cab5544da5011a7c400fdb5a141.webm?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/01bf3cab5544da5011a7c400fdb5a141.mp4?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face The Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful bosses and unlock them as playable characters after you defeat them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/c9b3077967d3acbf795903d7d70dda79.poster.avif?t=1773744850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/c9b3077967d3acbf795903d7d70dda79.webm?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/c9b3077967d3acbf795903d7d70dda79.mp4?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain Powerful Abilities </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain, unlock and improve various abilities on different characters every run. Try different playstyles and strategies to see what works best for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/6b3bfb256003b8c141d1ac2cc9b93545.poster.avif?t=1773744850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/6b3bfb256003b8c141d1ac2cc9b93545.webm?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/6b3bfb256003b8c141d1ac2cc9b93545.mp4?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Unique Features.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible environments:</strong> Everything in the world is destructible. You can use it to your advantage to defeat your enemies or just for pure fun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid fast paced 6DOF (Degrees of Freedom) combat:</strong> Soar in the skies, climb on any surface, fight in the caves and craters as you create them. The options are limitless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more to come...</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/78fa5a9d734c5f507d7edcacc73a15a9.poster.avif?t=1773744850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/78fa5a9d734c5f507d7edcacc73a15a9.webm?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504000/extras/78fa5a9d734c5f507d7edcacc73a15a9.mp4?t=1773744850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_